    "updated_at": "2021-04-13T19:00:36Z",
    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loop-for-spec-authors is relevant here.\r\n\r\nIn general, you can use the JSON-derived JavaScript values if you have a JS engine available and are prepared to handle all the wackiness of JS properties yourself. (Although that wackiness is somewhat constrained for JSON-produced objects, it isn't fully, e.g. you can still accidentally trigger getters on the prototype if you don't use exactly the right incantations.)",
